{"kind":"stack","id":"stk-levers","title":"Levers, pulleys and gears: a smaller force, a bigger effect","theme":{"background":"#f4f9f1","foreground":"#1d3b24","font":"Nunito, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Lever"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A bar that turns around a fixed point called a pivot. A small push on one end can lift a heavy load at the other end."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Pulley"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"A wheel with a rope running over it. Pulling the rope down can lift a load up, and several pulleys together can make the load feel lighter."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"A see-saw works like a lever. Where should the pivot be placed to make it easiest to lift a heavy friend?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a1","label":"Close to the heavy friend","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a2","label":"In the middle, between the two ends","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a3","label":"Far from the heavy friend, near your end","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Using a single fixed pulley, how does pulling the rope change the force you need?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a1","label":"You need more force than the load weighs","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a2","label":"You need the same force as the load weighs","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a3","label":"You need less force, half the load weight","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"cog"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Two gears are joined. The small gear turns the big gear. What happens to the turning force on the big gear?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a1","label":"It gets bigger","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a2","label":"It stays exactly the same","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a3","label":"It gets smaller, but it turns more slowly","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"Which tool uses a lever to help you do more with less force?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a1","label":"A pair of scissors","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a2","label":"A drinking glass","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a3","label":"A pencil case","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-q","content":"You must move a heavy box up a ramp. Do you use a long lever or a pulley to help?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a1","label":"Use a long lever","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a2","label":"Use a pulley","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"You push the long lever down and the box rises slowly and steadily. Your arms feel the work less than you expected."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"You hook the rope over the pulley and pull. The box lifts easily, and you only need a gentle tug."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"In both story paths, the box was lifted by a smaller force. What makes this possible?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a1","label":"The machine adds extra force to the load","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a2","label":"The machine spreads the effort over a longer distance","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a3","label":"The box became lighter on its own","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"Well done: you explored levers, pulleys and gears!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"You now know how a small force can have a big effect. Keep looking for these machines around you."}],"actions":[]}}
